<title>FINLAND: ILKKA SAYS HAS 9.52 PCT OF K-P KIRJAPAINO.</title>
<headline>ILKKA SAYS HAS 9.52 PCT OF K-P KIRJAPAINO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish publisher Ilkka Oy said in a statement on Monday it had bought 6.42 percent of shares in Keski-Pohjanmaan Kirjapaino Oy, upping its stake to 9.52 percent of shares and 13.45 percent of votes.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
